              "pages": {
                "end": 39,
                "start": 39
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. GALANTER, respondents contend that the district court's orders treat similar protests differently and that this reading is unfair."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Ms. Seitz",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "4981c3b5eb6c16713c8bcc0f03c45df7bf8f8e070e9cdb4f98aa9cdce58729fd",
